        "statement": "•Materiality: Our group regularly conducts regular materiality assessments, taking a double-materiality approach, defining material sustainability considerations as those with the potential to significantly impact our group’s business, the natural environment where we operate, and our group’s stakeholders, including our people and the communities where we operate.",
